at application into your Contoso University website in a way that is intuitive and  user-friendly.  A Person \"has a\" Address object (use composition for this). An Address object has a single property of type string for Email (for simplicity that's all an Address has)   A Student \"has a\" CreditsEarned property 10 pts: A Student \"has a\" Gpa property that can express overall grades with exactly 2 decimal points, such as 3.87, etc.  Use data attributes to insure that Email addresses entered into the system conform with the pattern [username]@contoso.edu. Hint: Refer to the regex material in the Galloway book.   Use data attributes to insure that Gpa is expressed as a value in range from 0.7 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":213179,"global_rank":260878},{"name":"laijiang19/watchout","owner":"laijiang19","html_url":"https://github.com/laijiang19/watchout","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213173,"global_rank":260897},{"name":"Mayalynn96/mayas-tentant-manager","owner":"Mayalynn96","html_url":"https://github.com/Mayalynn96/mayas-tentant-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":5,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213173,"global_rank":260903},{"name":"abdi208/tetris","owner":"abdi208","html_url":"https://github.com/abdi208/tetris","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213172,"global_rank":260904},{"name":"abdi208/canvasGame","owner":"abdi208","html_url":"https://github.com/abdi208/canvasGame","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213172,"global_rank":260905},{"name":"kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","owner":"kwokwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","stars":1,"forks":0,"wat